# Firmware images are build artifacts, not source, matching how the repo
# already treats companion/*.uf2 and companion/firmware/*.uf2.
#
# This file is tracked so the directory always exists for `make` to write into.
# If you want to commit a specific image (a tagged release candidate, say),
# force-add it: git add -f uf2_builds/ds5-bridge-160826-1210.uf2
*.uf2
